          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You call on the spirit of the dragon that devoured the moon to temporarily swallow a celestial body and blind onlookers with its visage. You can cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Eclipse Burst] as a primal innate spell once per day. When you Cast the Spell, the sun or moon appears to eclipse to all creatures within 500 feet of you. For 1 round after Casting the Spell, the area is reduced to dim light.</p>"
